he function $A(x,y)$ is a vector field on ${R}^{2}.$ It maps every point in the set $S,$ given by\n\n$$\nS=\\{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,|\\,x+y>-1\\}\n$$\n\nto a vector in ${R}^{2}.$\n\n- The function $B(x,y,z)$ is *not* a vector field on ${R}^{2}.$ It is a vector field on ${R}^{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $A(x,y)$ $=⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-y),\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y+1)⟩$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186567231 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e216b54-3105-5bba-8558-960e7437f115" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186567190} {:answer/id #uuid "79c44a8f-9149-58c3-bc99-49bc40412f79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186567206}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "79c44a8f-9149-58c3-bc99-49bc40412f79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186567206} :answer-field/id #uuid "03913288-f4c8-5caa-b009-cf8b543f4718" :answer-field/key "$C(t)=⟨2-{t}^{2},{e}^{t-1}⟩$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186567188} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d70cf5a4-bb36-520b-8a7c-e89b04e60e3e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186567226} {:answer/id #uuid "d7a02875-02cc-550f-9d11-9ae466df6873" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186567227}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d70cf5a4-bb36-520b-8a7c-e89b04e60e3e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186567226} :answer-field/id #uuid "cf0499ee-048f-5d24-8ef1-b8b998c793c5" :answer-field/key "$B(x,y,z)=⟨-2x,3{y}^{3},{z}^{5}⟩$" 